**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/requirements*.txt
**/pyproject.toml
**/Pipfile*
**/Dockerfile
**/docker-compose.yml
**/alembic.ini
**/Makefile
**/go.mod
**/CivicOs/
**/app/
**/cmd/
**/internal/
**/python-rag-service/
**/scripts/
**/tests/
**/data/
**/eval/
**/schema/
**/docs/
**/civicos.egg-info/
